    known or unknown bugs, errors, or defects in the Work.
 c. To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Owner shall not
    be liable to any person on any legal theory for any damages, whether
    direct, indirect, special, incidental, consequential, punitive, or
    exemplary, arising from or related to this document or the use of
